{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32064","headline":"病鹘吟 · 贾岛","name":"病鹘吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俊鸟还投高处栖，腾身戛戛下云梯。\n有时透雾凌空去，无事随风入草迷。\n迅疾月边捎玉兔，迟回日里拂金鸡。\n不缘毛羽遭零落，焉肯雄心向尔低。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}